      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CYCLONE ROBYN (9) made a good start to her career two weeks ago, beaten 1.75 metres into third over 1609m at Newcastle. Has to contend with a very wide draw. Meets a comparable field and she can make the breakthrough. LUCIENDO BIEN (5) finished third at this track two runs ago before finishing ninth at his latest appearance over 1730m at Bathurst, beaten 40 metres. Tackles a similar assignment and he can find winning ways. ROCKIN AT MIDNIGHT (7) is stepping out for the first time. By Capt Midnight and hails from the Scott Hewitt stable. The driver has some work to do from this wide starting position. Placed in a recent trial and is sure to prove very hard to beat. WILDFIRE STRIDE (1) is at the track for the first time. By Captaintreacherous and hails from the Rickie Alchin stable. Sure to enjoy an economical run from this draw. Placed in a recent trial. Has the right credentials to play a major role.",
